WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:09.807
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:09.808 --> 00:00:16.358
What do they have?

3
00:00:16.359 --> 00:00:23.749
Blobs, are those magic beans?

4
00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:36.778
The blobs plant the beans.

5
00:00:36.779 --> 00:00:52.746
They see a huge beanstalk.

6
00:00:52.747 --> 00:01:04.215
They climb up, up, up.

7
00:01:04.216 --> 00:01:10.831
They see a huge house.

8
00:01:10.832 --> 00:01:17.685
They go inside.

9
00:01:17.686 --> 00:01:23.976
They see gold coins.

10
00:01:23.977 --> 00:01:30.969
They see a hen.

11
00:01:30.970 --> 00:01:49.821
They hear a singing harp.

12
00:01:49.822 --> 00:02:01.641
Stomp! Now they see huge feet!

13
00:02:01.642 --> 00:02:06.789
"Fee, fi, fo, fum."

14
00:02:06.790 --> 00:02:11.465
It's an ogre! Blobs, run!

15
00:02:11.466 --> 00:02:14.518
Silly blobs!

16
00:02:14.519 --> 00:02:18.734
Good-bye!

